Topic 10 – Methods
Objective: Method declaration, invocation, parameters, return values, overloading and recursion.
No.	Program	Requirement
01	Simple Method	Create a method that prints a welcome message and invoke it from main().
02	Method with Parameters	Create a method that accepts two integers and prints their sum.
03	Method with Return Value	Create a method that accepts two numbers and returns their multiplication result.
04	Odd or Even Method	Create a method that accepts an integer and returns whether it is even or odd.
05	Largest Number Method	Create a method that accepts three numbers and returns the largest number.
06	Calculator Methods	Create separate methods for addition, subtraction, multiplication and division.
07	Method Overloading	Create overloaded methods to calculate the sum of 2, 3 and 4 integers.
08	String Method	Create a method that accepts a string and returns the reversed string.
09	Factorial Using Recursion	Calculate factorial using a recursive method.
10	Fibonacci Using Recursion	Create a recursive method to calculate a Fibonacci number